<title>SINGAPORE: Uraco 1996/97 half-yr profits up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Uraco 1996/97 half-yr profits up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   8.23    vs     6.98</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  2.69    vs     2.42</p>
<p>    Turnover			    77.98    vs    53.13</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    1.39    vs     0.95</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 1.19    vs     0.29</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	   4.32    vs     2.91</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	  0.08    vs     0.13</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     8.69    vs     6.93</p>
<p>    Tax				    0.46    vs     0.26</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		  0.08    vs     0.18 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Uraco Holdings Ltd is a precision engineering company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
